## Synchronization

Telling your reviewer that X happens before Y

Thread1
```
mu.Lock()
counter++
mu.Unlock()
```

Thread2
```
mu.Lock()
// Any value read by counter must have been a culmination
// of increments that _happened before_ the read due to the mu.Lock
fmt.Println(counter)
mu.Unlock()
```
